    "group": "Cohort Acquisitus",
    "summary": "Friendly **PTERAXII**, **INFILTRATORS**, **RANGERS**, **SERBERYS RAIDERS** and **SERBERYS SULPHURHOUNDS** units gain the **RECON AUGURY** keyword.\n\n**RECON AUGURY** units of yours gain **Enhanced Augurs**: in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), the unit may make a **[visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility)** enemy unit up to 12\" away **analysed**. An **analysed** unit gets +3\" to its **detection range**.",
